{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>TUNESTRIKE</strong>, music isn\u2019t just background \u2014 it\u2019s the core of the battle. Shoot, dodge, and chain combos to the beat in intense combat that tests both your aim and sense of rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Rhythmic combat</strong>: shoot and reload to the tempo to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>: tracks composed to perfectly match each level and enemy pattern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Beat-driven enemies</strong>: robots that attack and move in sync with the music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Variety of weapons</strong>: each with its own style and rhythmic firing patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Immersive environments</strong>: dynamic settings that react to the music and your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Scoring and combo system</strong>: rewards precision and consistent rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Progressive difficulty curve</strong>: levels designed to challenge both newcomers and rhythm game veterans.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936290?t=1759499605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936290?t=1759499605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936290/1c95f7cb3d44fd5661072846bcad4c5563c1c52c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759499605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936290/1c95f7cb3d44fd5661072846bcad4c5563c1c52c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759499605","categories":[{"description":"